%% Unit testing — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid. No Markdown fence.

flowchart TD
    trigger([About to write a test]) --> asked{Did the owner ASK<br/>for tests here?}

    asked -->|no| skip[Do not write them.<br/>The fleet writes automated tests<br/>only on request. Verify instead:<br/>typecheck · lint · build · run-to-verify]
    asked -->|yes| earns{Does this unit EARN a test?}

    earns -->|"pure logic · Zod schema · unit conversion<br/>· date/timezone maths · reducer<br/>· service mapper · query builder<br/>· outbox replay · entitlement eval"| write
    earns -->|"markup · styling · third-party behaviour<br/>· trivial getter · that a route renders"| no[Skip it.<br/>A snapshot of markup asserts nothing<br/>and breaks on every restyle]

    write[Write it] --> mock{Does it cross a boundary?}

    mock -->|yes| boundary[Mock YOUR SERVICE MODULE.<br/>Not the network — someone else's wire format.<br/>Not the DB client — breaks on refactor,<br/>not on behaviour change]
    mock -->|no| interact

    boundary --> interact{Does it simulate interaction?}

    interact -->|yes| ue[user-event, NEVER fireEvent.<br/>fireEvent.click dispatches ONE event;<br/>a real click is six, and focus order<br/>depends on them]
    interact -->|no| time

    ue --> query[Query by role → label → text.<br/>Test ids LAST — a role query also<br/>asserts the accessible name exists]
    query --> time

    time{Time or date dependent?}
    time -->|yes| timers[vi.useFakeTimers + vi.setSystemTime<br/>so 'today' is not the machine's today]
    time -->|no| run

    timers --> run[Run the whole suite,<br/>not just the new file]

    run --> seq{Passes alone but FAILS in sequence?}
    seq -->|yes| leak[🔴 Vitest 4: restoreAllMocks no longer<br/>resets vi.fn — only spyOn.<br/>Use resetAllMocks or mockClear]
    leak --> run

    seq -->|no| cov{Coverage set as a FLOOR<br/>on named core modules?}
    cov -->|"a global percentage"| fix[Replace it. A global number drives<br/>tests for getters — the cheapest way<br/>to raise it is to test what never breaks]
    fix --> cov

    cov -->|yes| snap{Any snapshot files?}
    snap -->|yes| del[Delete them. Banned.]
    del --> snap
    snap -->|none| done([Done: small suite, real risk covered,<br/>green in under a minute])

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class asked,earns,mock,interact,time,seq,cov,snap gate
    class trigger,done terminal
